# Unity C# style

RulePackVersion: 1.3.0
Mode: stack-unity

- ScriptableObject config assets: prefer auto-properties or public fields; flag passthrough getters with no logic.
- Flag runtime mutation of shared ScriptableObject assets in gameplay code.
- Inline comments explain why - not line narration or inspector setup.